+         * composite makes a 1280x720 surface at 0x1E30000, the 2560x720 lit-scene target of the colour grade
+         * that reads itself) the grade sampled that other surface, last frame's graded picture, and graded it
+         * again every frame until the screen was the LUT's white end. LD_NO_SELF_EXACT=1 = old behaviour. */
